,{33x-66}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,52\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are \n\n$\\,$ $11{x}^{2}+10x+33\\,$ and $\\,10{x}^{2}+13x-14.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-105589" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "37f4fba8af6c9d082645aad0e8d48fb15b942519a42465a144f89be1051a5d0e"} {"question" "q-105589" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-105589" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "$11{x}^{2}+10x+33\\,$ and $\\,10{x}^{2}+13x-14$"] ["text" "$11{x}^{2}+20x-28\\,$ and $\\,20{x}^{2}-12x+14$"] ["text" "$11{x}^{2}-10x+28\\,$ and $\\,10{x}^{2}+12x+14$"] ["text" "$11{x}^{2}-10x+33\\,$ and $\\,-10{x}^{2}+13x+14$"] ["text" "$11{x}^{2}-20x-28\\,$ and $\\,20{x}^{2}-12x-14$"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-105589" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "$11{x}^{2}+10x+33\\,$ and $\\,10{x}^{2}+13x-14$"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-38049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+8x+2 \\\\  & x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}-30x-8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{3}-24{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8{x}^{2}-30x-8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{2}-32x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, $\\frac{6{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}-30x-8}{x-4}=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-38049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+8x+2 \\\\  & x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}-30x-8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{3}-24{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8{x}^{2}-30x-8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{2}-32x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $6{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}-30x-8$ by the linear binomial $x-4$ gives\n\n- the quotient $6{x}^{2}+8x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder $0.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{6{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}-30x-8}{x-4}=6{x}^{2}+8x+2+\\frac{0}{x-4}=6{x}^{2}+8x+2.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-38049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :questi