ollowing:\n\n| $3{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+2x+2$ | $=$ | {{field-1}} | $-\\,\\,$ | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x+2$ |  | $x+2$ |  |  |  |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-320865" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{2}-x+4 \\\\  & x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+2x+2\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}+2x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-{x}^{2}-2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4x+8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $3{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+2x+2$ by the linear binomial $x+2$ gives\n\n- the quotient $3{x}^{2}-x+4,$ and\n\n- the remainder $-6.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{3{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+2x+2}{x+2}=3{x}^{2}-x+4-\\frac{6}{x+2}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-320865" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "37f4fba8af6c9d082645aad0e8d48fb15b942519a42465a144f89be1051a5d0e"} {"question" "q-320865" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621f