ory" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-114266" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x$-term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows:\n\n$$\n4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+0x+8\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-2x+3 \\\\  & 4x+6\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+0x+8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,8{x}^{2}+0x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,8{x}^{2}-12x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,12x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12x+18}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\,$ ${x}^{2}-2x+3\\,$ and $\\,-8{x}^{2}-12x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-114266" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "37f4fba8af6c9d082645aad0e8d48fb15b942519a42465a144f89be1051a5d0e"} {"question" "q-114266" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14054087/state.json" "file_sha256" "51621fba6a71d097a49ff59c5aee2107677bf3bc1b4fc00f89571ef0457deb9b"} {"question" "q-114266" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "